e twin prandial dilemma: cooperating works out to -5+3q in expected years against defecting's -4q, so cooperation only wins when q is above 5/7. I'm noting that the threshold matches the one from the other framing, and that the same model and decision are in play.\n\nI'm treating the two players as running the same reasoning, so I'm estimating their choices are correlated enough that q clears 5/7, and I'm settling on a pass as the answer for this fictional game.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the expected-value comparison for the twin prandial dilemma: cooperating works out to -5+3q in expected years against defecting's -4q, so cooperation only wins when q is above 5/7. I'm noting that the threshold matches the one from the other framing, and that the same model and decision are in play.\n\nI'm treating the two players as running the same reasoning, so I'm estimating their choices are correlated enough that q clears 5/7, and I'm settling on a pass as the answer for this fictional game.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9259,"completion_tokens":821,"total_tokens":10080,"cost":0.053456,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.053456,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.037036,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01642},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":276,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}